acter builds.<br></li><li> <strong>Empower Your Orbs:</strong> Choose from 20 enhancements to fortify your orbs, refining your gameplay approach.<br></li><li> <strong>Fight 30 Distinct Foes:</strong> Confront a roster of 30 distinct enemy types, each with unique behaviors and challenges.<br></li><li> <strong>Adapt with Enemy Resources:</strong> Seize enemies, their tools, and weapons to bolster your deck's strength and versatility.<br></li><li> <strong>Diverse Artifact Collection:</strong> Stumble upon 30 distinct artifacts, bestowing either empowering enhancements or daunting curses.<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Encounters:</strong> Experience random events, interact with shopkeepers, and engage in interactions between battles.</li></ul><br>Are you ready to challenge the shadowy depths of Gamble Tower, where every step can be decided by the roll of a dice? The ultimate gambit awaits \u2013 for only the boldest gamblers will emerge victorious.",
